    "detail": {
      "id": 1000975,
      "name": "[Affinity] The Phantom Thief's Magic",
      "desc": "Hugo has evoked the Mindscape Cinema: <color=#FFAF2C>[The Child Within]</color>.\n[The Child Within]: When <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate: Blaspheme</color> triggers <color=#FFFFFF>Totalize</color>, it will not end the enemy's Stunned state. Additionally, when <color=#FFFFFF>Totalize</color> is triggered, the skill will ignore 15% of the enemy's DEF.",
      "desc2": "In New Eridu, there's only Ether, no magic — unless you trust the mischievous glint in the eyes of the phantom thief.\nHere, you see the unyielding flames and the quiet frost intertwining, revealing a harsh truth mingled with gentle lies.",
